		{"id":"ddce5f4c1c284361","type":"group","x":-500,"y":-934,"width":660,"height":208,"label":"Tech Trees"},
		{"id":"09bc7719dda89bfc","type":"text","text":"# [[All Entities]]\nLists all the cards for units/structures so far.\nSorted by armour types.","x":252,"y":-1168,"width":229,"height":174},
		{"id":"24f86385bdc55ac3","type":"text","text":"# [[Maps.canvas|Maps]]","x":251,"y":-1288,"width":115,"height":60},
		{"id":"ec1b12cd0bbec985","type":"file","file":"Media/offi_dow4.png","x":251,"y":-1629,"width":113,"height":113},
		{"id":"9af4eceee9d39e17","type":"text","text":"## Sources\n- Closed Beta oct26\n- [Battle Report 3](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yvhL7ben1Wc)\n- [Battle Report 4](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ansr816Iujk)\n- [Battle Report 5]([https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg](https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg \"https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg\")","x":251,"y":-1516,"width":216,"height":183},
		{"id":"4bf386f695a5b320","type":"file","file":"Maps Of Content/Mechanics.md","x":567,"y":-1629,"width":230,"height":1470},
		{
			"id":"514da6be40324e83",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"> [!Welcome]\n> This is a compilation of all the info from the Orktober Closed Beta.\n> \n> Click the tree links below to explore the tech trees of the different factions.\n> \n> Check the MOC (Maps of Content) folder for different ways to view info.\n> \n> Best viewed with the [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md/) app (free).\n> Get the latest version of this Obsidian vault with [git](https://gitlab.com/dow4-vault/DoW4-Obsidian).\n> Either pull, or download the .zip from there, extract it and then \"Open folder as vault\" into Obsidian.\n> The repo now has branches for each builds.\n> \n> Tags can be used to search for specific stuff.\n> \n> Use Ctrl+O to open cards with fuzzy finding.\n> \n> Most cards now have 'properties', and bases can be used to sort things out. I've included some pre-made views, but if you're using Obsidian, feel free make your own.\n> \n> This is all very much W.I.P..\n> Join the official [DoW4 Discord](http://discord.gg/dawnofwar4).\n> -- Artist",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null,
				"border":null
			},
			"x":-502,
			"y":-1629,
			"width":660,
			"height":608
		},
