		{"id":"2b5be90b5116ace8","type":"text","text":"# [[Adeptus Mechanicus Tree.canvas|Adeptus Mechanicus]]","x":-63,"y":-821,"width":197,"height":73,"color":"#f2f2f2"},
		{"id":"32ebe2c64d2addbf","type":"text","text":"# [[Space Marines Tree.canvas|Space Marines]]","x":-420,"y":-821,"width":229,"height":72,"color":"#f2e5c7"},
		{
			"id":"07af4b791d879836",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Beta\n> The \"Armour Effectiveness\" values might not reflect the actual balance of the unit.\n\nAs it turns out the \"Armour Effectiveness\" tooltips are meaningless, I won't update them all until we figure out what they even mean.\nA wurrboy with 55-76 vs vehicles still does 240 every hit vs a spyder, so what are those 2 numbers in the first place??\nI'll be adding actual observed damage values from testing when possible, though I only got a handful of these. the fact that the weapons I tested actually had fixed damage per hit did allow me to find out some buff amounts.\nSo I got that going for me, which is nice.\n\n--Artist",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-502,
			"y":-673,
			"width":493,
			"height":449
		}
